1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,549
Now watch the thorns.

2
00:00:01,549 --> 00:00:07,265
Evans climbs into the hole and heaves out a heavy bar; a little thorn pricks his hand.

3
00:00:07,265 --> 00:00:11,692
He pulls it out and carries on, piling ingots on his jacket.

4
00:00:11,692 --> 00:00:13,190
Another little thorn.

5
00:00:13,190 --> 00:00:19,062
He grows irritable, his arms ache, the forest feels stuffy, he snaps at Hooker.

6
00:00:19,062 --> 00:00:23,294
Then he stumbles, clutches his throat, and slides down a tree.

7
00:00:23,294 --> 00:00:28,919
And as Hooker gathers up the gold, he feels a little prick on the ball of his thumb.

